alias alg_projective_homogeneous_equations := Multigraph.incidenceProjectiveEquation_from_homogeneous

/-- **`alg:incidence-vector-bundle` (independent global zero scheme)** Proved. The scheme
glued from original quotient faces is isomorphic to the independently constructed closed
