/-- **`alg:state-cohomology` (product laws on actual cohomology)** Proved auxiliary.
For nonpositive twists over a Noetherian base, the product of actual cohomology is associative, with the transport of twists and degrees. -/
alias alg_vertex_product_assoc := ProjectiveLine.vertexNegativeProduct_assoc'

/-- **`alg:state-cohomology` (product laws on actual cohomology)** Proved auxiliary.
The product of actual cohomology of nonpositive twists is graded commutative with the sign (-1)^(ij). -/
alias alg_vertex_product_comm := ProjectiveLine.vertexNegativeProduct_comm'

/-- **`alg:state-cohomology` (product laws on actual cohomology)** Proved auxiliary.
The actual class of the original constant-one cell cocycle is a left unit. -/
