/-- **`alg:state-cohomology` (product acceptance examples)** Proved auxiliary.
For three vertices the two bracketings of the three degree-one generators agree. -/
alias alg_state_cup_example_three_assoc := CechProduct.threeVertex_cup_assoc

/-- **`alg:state-cohomology` (product acceptance examples)** Proved auxiliary.
Their product is the three-factor Laurent gap state of twist (-2,-2,-2), up to the sign of the vertex enumeration. -/
