/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (exterior bundle)** Proved auxiliary.
The actual exterior bundle in degree one is the dual edge bundle. -/
alias alg_exterior_bundle_one := Multigraph.exteriorBundleOneIso

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (exterior bundle)** Proved auxiliary.
Actual cohomology of the exterior bundle splits linearly as the product over edge sets of cohomology of the twists -d_S. -/
alias alg_exterior_bundle_cohomology := Multigraph.exteriorBundleCohomologyLinearEquiv

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (exterior bundle)** Proved auxiliary.
Over a Noetherian base, actual cohomology of the exterior bundle is the product of the state pieces of its summands. -/
alias alg_exterior_bundle_states := Multigraph.exteriorBundleStateLinearEquiv

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (exterior bundle)** Proved auxiliary.
Actual cohomology of the q-th exterior bundle vanishes above degree q. -/
alias alg_exterior_bundle_vanishing := Multigraph.exteriorBundleCohomology_eq_zero_of_lt

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism`** Proved (with the exterior bundle as the actual finite biproduct of the twist sheaves L(-d_S)).
For p ≤ q, the internal-degree-q piece of actual Tor_p of the incidence ring over the coefficient origin is ℂ-linearly isomorphic to actual Ext-defined H^{q-p} of the q-th exterior bundle on the product of projective lines over ℂ. -/
alias alg_tor_isomorphism := Multigraph.incidenceTorExteriorEquiv

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism`** Proved. The isomorphism sends the standard Tor product to the exterior product, (-1)^(q·j) times the standard cup with the exterior pairing, with the explicit degree identity (q-p)+(q'-p') = (q+q')-(p+p'). -/
alias alg_tor_isomorphism_mul := Multigraph.incidenceTorExteriorEquiv_product

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism`** Proved. The isomorphism sends the Tor unit to the exterior unit, the constant section in the empty summand. -/
alias alg_tor_isomorphism_one := Multigraph.incidenceTorExteriorEquiv_one

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (state vectors)** Proved auxiliary.
The state vector of the image of a Tor class is the full state vector of that Tor class. -/
alias alg_tor_isomorphism_state := Multigraph.exteriorCohomologyState_incidenceTorExteriorEquiv

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (Tor side)** Proved auxiliary.
