/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (exterior side)** Proved auxiliary. The exterior cohomology product is associative, with transport of degrees. -/
alias alg_exterior_product_assoc := Multigraph.exteriorCohomologyProduct_assoc

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (exterior side)** Proved auxiliary. The exterior unit is a left unit. -/
alias alg_exterior_product_unit_left := Multigraph.exteriorCohomologyProduct_unit_left

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (chart identification)** Proved auxiliary.
On every open inside a standard chart, in degrees at least one, the wedge map from the exterior power of the sections of the dual edge bundle to the sections of the exterior bundle is bijective. -/
alias alg_exterior_chart_wedge_bijective := Multigraph.exteriorSectionWedge_bijective

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (chart identification)** Proved auxiliary.
