alias alg_exterior_chart_wedge_mul := Multigraph.exteriorSectionPairing_wedge

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (chart identification)** Proved auxiliary.
The sheaf pairing that defines the exterior cohomology product is, on the sections over every open, the section exterior pairing. -/
alias alg_exterior_pairing_bridge := Multigraph.exteriorWedgePairing_eq_sectionPairing

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (chart identification)** Proved auxiliary.
In every degree, including zero, the sheaf pairing of the exterior product sends wedges of sections of the dual edge bundle to the wedge of the appended tuple. -/
alias alg_exterior_pairing_wedge := Multigraph.exteriorWedgePairing_wedgeAll

/-- **`alg:tor-isomorphism` (chart identification)** Proved auxiliary.
In every degree, including zero, the wedge map is bijective on every open inside a standard chart. -/
alias alg_exterior_chart_wedge_bijective_all := Multigraph.exteriorSectionWedgeAll_bijective

/-- **`supp:zero-couplings`** Proved. On every admissible real solution the messages on the
